## Lab Environment Notes

- VirtualBox networking: put attacker (Kali) and target on the same **Host-only** or **NAT Network** adapter so they can reach each other. Plain "NAT" isolates each VM individually.
- Host-only has no internet access by design. If Kali needs both internet and lab access, add a second adapter (Adapter 2 = NAT, Adapter 1 = Host-only).
- `ip a` to check your own interface/IP. Subnet for scanning = your IP's first three octets + `.0/24`.